01:08:14.900 --> 01:08:16.100
How do you know?


01:08:16.300 --> 01:08:18.500
I'm a cop.
I'm good at what I do.


01:08:18.600 --> 01:08:19.600
The truth is?


01:08:20.700 --> 01:08:22.900
The truth is, my mom and I...


01:08:24.200 --> 01:08:26.000
I hadn't spoken
to her


01:08:27.400 --> 01:08:28.200
for years.


01:08:28.400 --> 01:08:29.400
I, um, I was


01:08:31.000 --> 01:08:35.000
3,000 miles away when I heard
about Rebecca and the stroke.


01:08:35.100 --> 01:08:35.800
I was just a kid.


01:08:35.900 --> 01:08:38.600
I... I couldn't get along
with her.


01:08:39.100 --> 01:08:40.000
I understand.


01:08:41.200 --> 01:08:42.000
You do?


01:08:42.200 --> 01:08:43.900
That's how I got here.


01:08:44.800 --> 01:08:47.800
I went 3,000 miles to get away
from someone I loved.


01:08:47.900 --> 01:08:50.500
