01:08:50.800 --> 01:08:51.700
Not anymore.


01:08:52.600 --> 01:08:54.400
You don't like to talk about it.


01:08:54.500 --> 01:08:57.200
Actually, I talk too much
about it.


01:08:59.900 --> 01:09:00.500
Well...


01:09:03.400 --> 01:09:04.400
...anyway, um,


01:09:04.500 --> 01:09:07.000
when I did find
out, I was lost.


01:09:08.800 --> 01:09:10.100
So you came home.


01:09:12.100 --> 01:09:13.900
You know, I'm from L.A.


01:09:14.200 --> 01:09:15.500
Where'd you live?


01:09:16.000 --> 01:09:17.000
