01:09:17.100 --> 01:09:18.900
Well above my pay grade.


01:09:21.600 --> 01:09:23.600
Your mom was
in a charity hospital.


01:09:23.700 --> 01:09:25.400
If I'm not being too nosy,


01:09:25.500 --> 01:09:28.000
