in Beverly Hills.


01:09:40.500 --> 01:09:41.600
Attractive how?


01:09:49.900 --> 01:09:52.400
What do you want
to talk about, Jesse?


01:09:52.500 --> 01:09:53.100
Baseball.


01:09:54.500 --> 01:09:56.900
Do you have someone
in Paradise?


01:09:57.800 --> 01:09:58.265
I did.


01:09:58.300 --> 01:10:00.900
But you' re not
seeing anyone now?


01:10:01.400 --> 01:10:02.600
I'm seeing you.


01:10:05.300 --> 01:10:06.800
How about those Sox?


01:10:17.200 --> 01:10:17.900
Well...


01:10:31.400 --> 01:10:33.100
It's been a long time.


01:10:41.200 --> 01:10:43.800
TAXI DRIVER:
Want me to come back?


01:10:48.800 --> 01:10:50.000
Keep the change.


01:10:50.600 --> 01:10:52.600
There won't be any change.


01:10:53.700 --> 01:10:55.300
Well, keep it anyway.


01:10:59.300 --> 01:11:00.100
Good night.


01:11:01.300 --> 01:11:02.100
Good night.


01:11:37.600 --> 01:11:43.600
_Aid you do?


01:11:44.600 --> 01:11:47.700
I hit somebody in the fist
with my face.


01:11:49.100 --> 01:11:50.000
So, Jesse...


01:11:51.700 --> 01:11:54.800
is there anything you need
to talk about?


01:11:55.800 --> 01:11:58.900
Did Molly call you
or did Rose call you?


01:11:59.000 --> 01:12:00.100
