01:12:00.600 --> 01:12:01.200
She's...


01:12:01.600 --> 01:12:02.300
Concerned?


01:12:03.600 --> 01:12:05.300
How are you with blood?


01:12:05.800 --> 01:12:07.700
I see blood all the time.


01:12:08.200 --> 01:12:11.000
It's just usually
child blood rather


01:12:11.400 --> 01:12:12.700
