Doc,


01:12:12.800 --> 01:12:15.700
you are rapidly spiraling
into pediatrician talk.


01:12:15.800 --> 01:12:16.400
Sorry, Jesse.


01:12:16.500 --> 01:12:20.100
I need your expert, grownup
medical examiner opinion here.


01:12:20.200 --> 01:12:20.800
Okay.


01:12:21.300 --> 01:12:24.100
Somebody gets shot,
do they bleed right away?


01:12:24.200 --> 01:12:25.300
Not necessarily.


01:12:28.000 --> 01:12:29.700
I'm studying at night.


01:12:29.900 --> 01:12:30.465
Good.


01:12:30.500 --> 01:12:33.700
So a gunshot victim might not
leave a blood trail


01:12:33.800 --> 01:12:34.800
