01:16:06.400 --> 01:16:07.500
Uh, yeah. Um...


01:16:09.000 --> 01:16:09.800
Waitress.


01:16:12.300 --> 01:16:14.100
Where was her residence?


01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:15.700
Inglewood.


01:17:07.800 --> 01:17:08.200
Jesse.


01:17:09.100 --> 01:17:10.100
What happened?


01:17:10.300 --> 01:17:11.100
I fell.


01:17:13.000 --> 01:17:14.500
You got some coffee?


01:17:18.200 --> 01:17:19.000
Long drive.


01:17:20.200 --> 01:17:21.000
Lot of traffic?


01:17:21.100 --> 01:17:24.700
Actually, I had to make sure
I wasn't followed.


01:17:25.800 --> 01:17:27.600
Turns out there
was a lot of money


01:17:27.700 --> 01:17:28.900
in Hasty's bank-
mob money.


01:17:29.000 --> 01:17:31.500
And I've been getting
the distinct impressión


01:17:31.600 --> 01:17:34.000
they'd like to have
what's left of it back.


01:17:34.100 --> 01:17:36.300
Do you think you were followed?


01:17:36.400 --> 01:17:38.400
I know I wasn't.
How do you know?


01:17:38.500 --> 01:17:41.000
I'm good at what
I do, Rebecca.


01:17:44.700 --> 01:17:45.800
Oh, I'm sorry.


01:17:46.300 --> 01:17:49.200
It's just that you and
your sister look so much alike.


01:17:49.300 --> 01:17:53.100
Of course, if Leeann was dressed
as a man, you wouldn't look


01:17:53.200 --> 01:17:55.300
anything like her, would you?


01:17:58.100 --> 01:17:59.100
I screwed up.


01:18:00.600 --> 01:18:01.200
I know better.


01:18:01.300 --> 01:18:02.900
It's not just men
who rob banks.


01:18:03.000 --> 01:18:05.700
It's not just men
who kill people.


01:18:13.700 --> 01:18:15.300
I didn't kill anyone.


01:18:16.500 --> 01:18:19.200
You mean, you didn't
shoot anybody.


01:18:22.000 --> 01:18:23.800
Look, it's just a theory so far,


01:18:23.900 --> 01:18:25.800
but it's a pretty good theory.


01:18:25.900 --> 01:18:27.800
Shouldn't be too hard to prove.


01:18:27.900 --> 01:18:29.800
You went to the dentist
as a kid.


01:18:29.900 --> 01:18:32.400
Dental records,
fingerprints, DNA.


01:18:34.500 --> 01:18:36.200
Something will tell us.


01:18:37.700 --> 01:18:38.800
And then what?


01:18:39.800 --> 01:18:42.000
Then I'll have to arrest you.


01:18:46.200 --> 01:18:50.300
Will you give me time
to make arrangements for my mom?


01:18:52.200 --> 01:18:53.300
Yeah, your mom.


01:18:57.200 --> 01:18:59.400
How much money
you got left?


01:18:59.500 --> 01:19:00.300
Not a lot.


01:19:01.100 --> 01:19:02.000
Enough to...


01:19:02.500 --> 01:19:05.000
Enough to make sure
I can take care of her.


01:19:05.100 --> 01:19:08.200
When you go to jail,
they take it away.


01:19:09.700 --> 01:19:11.400
I talked Leeann into it


01:19:13.200 --> 01:19:15.000
when I found out
how much money


01:19:15.100 --> 01:19:17.700
there was going
through that bank.


01:19:18.300 --> 01:19:19.900
We never had anything.


01:19:20.100 --> 01:19:22.700
We thought
we were going to travel


01:19:23.600 --> 01:19:25.500
and do anything we wanted.


01:19:28.900 --> 01:19:30.600
It just seemed so easy.


01:19:30.800 --> 01:19:32.900
We thought we were so smart.


01:19:33.000 --> 01:19:34.000
It was smart.


01:19:36.300 --> 01:19:39.500
WOMAN
Light to moderate training...


01:19:39.600 --> 01:19:41.300
Unintended consequences.


01:19:43.500 --> 01:19:47.500
The bank guard hit what
he was aiming at, didn't he?


01:19:48.000 --> 01:19:51.800
Leeann died where we planned
to change our clothes,


01:19:52.400 --> 01:19:53.000
so I...


01:19:57.300 --> 01:20:00.600
I put my clothes on her,
and I buried her.


01:20:05.200 --> 01:20:06.100
Mutual fund companies


01:20:06.200 --> 01:20:07.600
are reporting
first quarter vestment...


01:20:07.700 --> 01:20:11.000
What do you think's going
to happen to her


01:20:11.800 --> 01:20:13.500
after I take you away?


01:20:22.900 --> 01:20:24.300
Oh, what the hell.


01:20:29.700 --> 01:20:32.400
You won't be hearing
from me again.


01:20:43.300 --> 01:20:45.200
What was that kiss about?


01:20:46.800 --> 01:20:47.400
You.


01:20:49.000 --> 01:20:50.900
I'd like to believe that.


01:21:03.800 --> 01:21:05.965
Platinum rose three dollars...


01:21:06.000 --> 01:21:08.800
FISH: Did you find what
you were looking for?


01:21:08.900 --> 01:21:13.000
I did. I found the money
Hasty was laundering for you.


01:21:15.100 --> 01:21:15.900
Hasty who?


01:21:16.300 --> 01:21:17.500
Let's not do this again.


01:21:17.600 --> 01:21:19.200
I don't know
what you' re talking about.


01:21:19.300 --> 01:21:23.200
If we' re going to be pals,
we have to find a way


01:21:23.300 --> 01:21:25.700
to be more honest
with each other.


01:21:25.800 --> 01:21:26.400
Ah.


01:21:27.000 --> 01:21:28.600
Not completely honest?


01:21:29.700 --> 01:21:30.600
More honest.


01:21:31.800 --> 01:21:32.500
Well...


01:21:33.600 --> 01:21:34.400
You first.


01:21:36.600 --> 01:21:38.200
Assuming I were interested


01:21:38.300 --> 01:21:40.300
