01:21:55.500 --> 01:21:58.300
You don't really expect me
to believe that?


01:21:58.400 --> 01:21:59.200
Not really.


01:22:01.300 --> 01:22:04.000
You don't know
where the money is?


01:22:05.300 --> 01:22:06.100
Not really.


01:22:09.500 --> 01:22:11.400
I'll pull off Mr. Genest.


01:23:13.800 --> 01:23:15.100
Jesse, it's Rose.


01:23:15.900 --> 01:23:17.000
Where are you?


01:23:55.400 --> 01:23:56.000
Hello?


01:23:59.400 --> 01:24:00.000
Hello?

